# Instant snow: where did the water go?
register lv2

# A matched water-only control stays ordinary liquid.
add v1 water 50mL
look v1

new beaker
add v2 instant_snow_powder 0.5g
add v2 water 50mL
look v2
inspect v2

# Nothing vanishes: water remains in the conserved ledger. The 100 g/g
# ceiling is a teaching capacity, not a product specification. Cross-link
# density, grain size, salt, pH, swelling time, volume and texture are outside
# this equilibrium mass-uptake model.
